{
  "date_key": "2026-11-05",
  "date_cn": "2026年11月05日",
  "day_cn": "周四",
  "english": "<div style=\"background:#eef5ff;border:1px solid #c7dcff;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px\"><div style=\"font-weight:700;color:#0d47a1;margin-bottom:8px\">🎧 双人地道对话发音</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#566;margin-bottom:9px\">A 男声 · B 女声 · 自然语速</div><audio controls preload=\"none\" style=\"width:100%\"><source src=\"https://gracieme.github.io/agent-for-news/audio/2026-11-05-dialogue.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><a href=\"https://gracieme.github.io/agent-for-news/audio/2026-11-05-dialogue.wav\" style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none\">▶ 播放或下载今日对话音频</a></div></div><div style=\"background:#e8f0fe;border-left:4px solid #1a73e8;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:15px\">【今日主题】</strong><span style=\"margin-left:8px;font-weight:400;color:#1a73e8\">音乐与演唱会（Music &amp; Concerts）</span></div>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<div style=\"background:#e3f2fd;border-left:4px solid #0d47a1;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#0d47a1;font-size:15px\">【英文原文】</strong></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">How was the indie rock gig last night? You were <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">super hyped up</span> about it all week.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">It was a mixed bag, honestly. I <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">paid an arm and a leg</span> because I got stung by dynamic pricing on the ticketing site. But the support act absolutely blew the headliner out of the water!</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Oh, really? I thought they were just some unknown local band.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Not anymore. They used to do the pub circuit around London, but their new sound is incredible. It’s quite a sonic departure from their early acoustic stuff. The lead guitarist even delivered a face-melting solo at the end of their set.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Sounds amazing. But what about the main band? Did they just <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">phone it in</span>?</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Sort of. The lead singer was a bit pitchy on the high notes. At one point, he completely forgot the second verse and just had to busk it until the chorus.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Yikes. That’s rough when you’ve paid top dollar. Did they at least play your favorite tracks?</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Barely! They ignored their old sleeper hit entirely. Instead, they played a deep cut from their 2018 EP that almost nobody in the crowd recognized.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Classic move when artists try to be overly artistic. Anyway, we need to focus on our house party tonight. Are you going to curate the vibe with your Spotify playlists?</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Way ahead of you. I’m mixing some old-school R&amp;B with a few modern pop anthems. We definitely need the right energy to get people <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">on the dance floor</span>.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f5e9;border-left:4px solid #1b5e20;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#1b5e20;font-size:15px\">【中文翻译】</strong></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">A：昨晚的独立摇滚演出怎么样？你整个星期都（对它期待得要命）呢。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">(How was the indie rock gig last night? You were <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">super hyped up</span> about it all week.)</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">B：说实话，好坏参半。因为票务网站的浮动定价，我（花了一大笔钱）挨了宰。但是暖场嘉宾绝对把主唱乐队秒杀得体无完肤！</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">(It was a mixed bag, honestly. I <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">paid an arm and a leg</span> because I got stung by dynamic pricing on the ticketing site. But the support act absolutely blew the headliner out of the water!)</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">A：哦，真的吗？我以为他们只是个不知名的本地乐队。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">(Oh, really? I thought they were just some unknown local band.)</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">B：现在不是了。他们以前常在伦敦的各大酒馆走穴演出，但他们的新曲风太棒了。相比他们早期的原声吉他风格，这真是一次巨大的音乐风格大转变。主音吉他手甚至在演出结束时来了一段燃爆全场的吉他独奏。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">(Not anymore. They used to do the pub circuit around London, but their new sound is incredible. It’s quite a sonic departure from their early acoustic stuff. The lead guitarist even delivered a face-melting solo at the end of their set.)</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">A：听起来很棒。但主打乐队怎么了？他们难道只是（在敷衍了事）吗？</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">(Sounds amazing. But what about the main band? Did they just <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">phone it in</span>?)</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">B：有点吧。主唱在唱高音时有点走调。甚至有一次，他完全忘了第二段主歌的歌词，只能硬着头皮即兴糊弄，直到唱到副歌。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">(Sort of. The lead singer was a bit pitchy on the high notes. At one point, he completely forgot the second verse and just had to busk it until the chorus.)</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">A：哎呀。当你花了大价钱买票时，这就太难受了。他们至少唱了你最喜欢的歌吗？</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">(Yikes. That’s rough when you’ve paid top dollar. Did they at least play your favorite tracks?)</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">B：几乎没有！他们完全没唱以前那首后来居上的冷门爆款歌。相反，他们演奏了2018年EP里的一首冷门非主打曲，观众里几乎没人听得出来。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">(Barely! They ignored their old sleeper hit entirely. Instead, they played a deep cut from their 2018 EP that almost nobody in the crowd recognized.)</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">A：这是艺术家们试图表现得过于艺术化时的经典操作。不管怎样，我们得专注于今晚的家庭派对了。你打算用你的Spotify歌单来精心营造氛围吗？</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">(Classic move when artists try to be overly artistic. Anyway, we need to focus on our house party tonight. Are you going to curate the vibe with your Spotify playlists?)</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">B：我早就准备好啦。我把一些老派R&amp;B和几首现代流行金曲混搭在了一起。我们绝对需要合适的氛围来让大家（走上舞池）。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">(Way ahead of you. I’m mixing some old-school R&amp;B with a few modern pop anthems. We definitely need the right energy to get people <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">on the dance floor</span>.)</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<div style=\"background:#f3e5f5;border-left:4px solid #4a148c;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#4a148c;font-size:15px\">【本日表达列表】</strong></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">01.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>get stung by dynamic pricing</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 因为系统根据需求临时抬高票价而大出血 / 挨宰</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用（票务时代新表达）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 抱怨购买演唱会门票或机票时遭遇价格背刺。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">02.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>blow the headliner out of the water</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 暖场嘉宾表现远超主打明星，把主角秒杀得体无完肤</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 评价演唱会或演出中，配角表现胜过主角。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">03.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>do the pub circuit</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 在各个小酒馆或小场地巡回走穴演出（通常指成名前）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 英国 / 爱尔兰 / 澳大利亚</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 谈论独立乐队或喜剧演员成名前的基层演出经历。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">04.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>a sonic departure</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 音乐风格上的重大转变 / 风格大变</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用（乐评界常用）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 形容一位歌手或乐队的新专辑与以往曲风截然不同。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">05.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>a face-melting solo</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 极其震撼、燃爆全场（甚至“令人面部融化”）的吉他独奏</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用（摇滚圈俚语）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 赞美摇滚乐或现场演出中极具爆发力的器乐独奏。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">06.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>a bit pitchy</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 音准有些偏离，稍微有点走调</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 美国 / 全球通用（受美国偶像等选秀节目影响）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 委婉批评某人的歌唱音准不够完美。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">07.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>busk it</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 在没有准备或忘词的情况下即兴发挥、硬着头皮糊弄过去</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 英国 / 澳大利亚</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 形容在舞台上发生意外（如忘词）时，靠临场反应蒙混过关。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">08.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>a sleeper hit</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 初期反响平平，但后来逐渐爆红的作品（后来居上的爆款）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 谈论那些发行时不火，靠口碑或网络传播突然走红的歌曲或电影。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">09.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>a deep cut</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 鲜为人知的冷门歌曲，非主打歌</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 美国 / 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 指代死忠粉才知道的、很少在电台播放或演唱会上表演的曲目。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">10.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>curate the vibe</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 精心挑选音乐或布置以营造特定的氛围</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 Gen Z / 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 为派对、聚餐或特定场合排布歌单、设计气氛。</span></td></tr></table>",
  "research": "<div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #d9eef2;border-radius:10px;padding:20px 22px;margin:16px 0;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05)\"><div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#00838f,#26c6da);color:#fff;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:6px;margin:-20px -22px 16px;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0.6px\">🎯 今日研究主线</div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#546e7a;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🧭 选题方向：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">Structural teacher vulnerability and institutional discourse</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#6a1b9a;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🧷 对应草稿：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">10.1080/09518398.2026.2736694</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#1565c0;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🔎 检索主题：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">teacher structural vulnerability institutional discourse bilingual education emotional labor</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#8e24aa;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🪄 为什么是它：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">延伸已发表的教师结构性脆弱研究，而不是泛泛推荐教师压力或倦怠文献。</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">✍️ 今天重点：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">寻找能把个人遭遇转化为制度机制的概念或方法，尤其关注责任、保护、可信度与教师声音。</td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:5px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#555;font-size:13px;padding-left:96px\">（今天没有论文同时通过启发性、主线相关性与质量门槛。宁缺毋滥，明天再看。）</p>\n</div>",
  "mentor": "<p style=\"margin:6px 0;color:#555;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8\">（今日暂无可精读的论文，请稍后查看）</p>",
  "news": "<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇨🇳 大中华视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm0qkxzv3j99o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">中国反驳巴布亚新几内亚发现炮弹的报道，称其或为酒瓶</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Weapon or wine bottle? China disputes reports of artillery shell in Papua New Guinea</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">此前有报道称巴布亚新几内亚发现了一枚来自中国的炮弹，引发国际关注。中国外交部对此予以否认，并表示这可能只是一个酒瓶，呼吁相关方避免不实猜测，并指出此事件不应影响中巴两国关系。（官方视角）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC中国报道</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.economist.com/china/2026/11/04/with-an-eye-on-america-china-is-beefing-up-its-ai-controlled-labs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">着眼于美国竞争，中国正在加强其人工智能控制的实验室建设</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">With an eye on America, China is beefing up its AI-controlled labs</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">为了在科技领域与美国抗衡，中国正大力投入建设由人工智能驱动的实验室。这些先进设施旨在提升科研效率和创新能力，尤其是在关键技术领域寻求突破，以增强国家战略竞争力。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">经济学人</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.scmp.com/week-asia/politics/article/3373305/south-korea-wants-cyber-tsar-can-it-beat-complacency\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">韩国拟设立网络沙皇，但能否克服自满情绪？</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">South Korea wants a cyber tsar, but can it beat complacency?</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">韩国计划设立“网络沙皇”一职，以加强国家网络安全防御能力。然而，该国长期存在的网络安全自满情绪以及官僚体制的阻力，可能成为新职位有效发挥作用的重大挑战。（批评性报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">南华早报(独立港媒)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.taipeitimes.com/News/front/archives/2026/11/05/2003867183\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">日本警察厅打击选举干预行为</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">NPA cracks down on election meddling</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">日本警察厅（NPA）正采取强硬措施，调查并打击涉嫌干预选举的活动。此举旨在维护选举的公正性和透明度，确保民主进程不受非法操纵或外部势力影响，以保障公民投票权。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">台北时报(台湾)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇺🇸 北美视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://foreignpolicy.com/2026/11/04/pakistan-us-trump-business-ties-lng-project/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">特朗普已改变美巴关系</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Trump Has Shifted the U.S.-Pakistan Relationship</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">特朗普政府的政策和言论对美国与巴基斯坦之间的双边关系产生了深远影响。两国长期以来的战略伙伴关系经历了显著调整，主要体现在军事援助、反恐合作和地区战略优先级上的变化。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">外交政策(外交专业)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.axios.com/2026/11/04/polling-midterms-accuracy-atlasintel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">本次中期选举民调结果与实际差距大于2016年</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Polls missed bigger on the midterms than in 2016</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">与2016年大选相比，此次美国中期选举的民意调查结果与最终实际票数之间的误差更大。这引发了对民调方法论和数据预测准确性的广泛质疑，尤其是在分析选民偏好和政治趋势方面。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Axios(简报风)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.npr.org/2026/11/04/nx-s1-6028833/midterms-ballot-measures-abortion-lgbtq-guns\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">美国选民在堕胎权、LGBTQ权利和枪支管制等州级投票措施上的立场</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Where voters stand on state ballot measures, from abortion to LGBTQ rights to guns</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">美国中期选举中，除了联邦层面的竞争，多州还就堕胎、LGBTQ权利和枪支管制等议题进行公民投票。选民对这些直接影响其生活的州级提案的态度，反映了美国社会在关键文化和政策问题上的分歧和共识。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">NPR(公共广播,中偏左)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.theatlantic.com/politics/2026/11/sand-turek-iowa-midterms-blue/689290/?utm_source=feed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">美国中西部地区重回民主党的政治版图</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">The Midwest Is Back on the Map for Democrats</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">在中期选举中，民主党在中西部地区取得重要进展，这扭转了该地区近年来向共和党倾斜的趋势。这一转变表明民主党在该传统工业地带的策略奏效，可能预示着未来美国政治版图的变动。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">The Atlantic(中偏左)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌍 欧洲视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c6x29rr8djy3o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">“这是一场灾难”：愤怒的共和党人将中期选举失利归咎于特朗普</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">&#x27;This is a disaster&#x27;: Angry Republicans blame Trump for midterms defeat</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">美国中期选举结果令共和党内部出现强烈不满，许多人将未能如预期掀起“红色浪潮”的责任归咎于前总统特朗普。这凸显了共和党内部对特朗普未来领导作用及其对选民吸引力的高度分歧。（批评性报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC世界</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://english.elpais.com/usa/2026-11-04/democrats-sweep-the-midterms-on-a-wave-of-rebuke-to-trumps-presidency.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">民主党在中期选举中大获全胜，回应了对特朗普总统任期的普遍谴责</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Democrats sweep the midterms on a wave of rebuke to Trump’s presidency</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">民主党在中期选举中表现超出预期，巩固了参议院控制权并在多个关键州获胜，被解读为选民对前总统特朗普及其政治遗产的明确否定。这一结果重塑了未来两年美国政治格局。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">西班牙El País</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/04/british-healthcare-worker-ebola-evacuated-drc-to-uk-document-shows\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">一名感染埃博拉病毒的英国医护人员从刚果民主共和国撤回英国接受治疗</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">British healthcare worker with Ebola evacuated from DR Congo to UK</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">一名在刚果民主共和国工作期间感染埃博拉病毒的英国医疗工作者已被紧急撤离回英国，将在伦敦皇家自由医院接受隔离治疗。这突显了全球疫情应对的挑战和国际医疗援助的风险。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">卫报(英国,中左)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.dw.com/en/winners-losers-the-eu-five-takeaways-from-the-us-midterms/a-79858901?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">赢家、输家和欧盟：美国中期选举的五大看点</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Winners, losers, the EU: Five takeaways from the US midterms</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">美国中期选举结束后，各方对其结果进行了深入分析，包括明确的赢家与输家，以及选举对欧盟等国际伙伴的影响。理解这些关键因素有助于把握美国国内外政策的未来走向。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">DW(德国,中立)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.france24.com/en/sport/20261104-champions-league-real-madrid-comeback-liverpool-fenerbahce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">欧冠战报：皇家马德里后来居上逆转取胜，利物浦不敌费内巴切</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Champions League: Real Madrid seal late comeback as Liverpool lose to Fenerbahce</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">在最新一轮欧洲冠军联赛小组赛中，西甲豪门皇家马德里在比赛最后阶段实现逆转，战胜对手；而英超劲旅利物浦则意外地输给了土耳其球队费内巴切，爆出冷门。（体育新闻）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">法国24(法国)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌏 亚太视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://newsinfo.inquirer.net/2336312/rainy-thursday-in-parts-of-ph-due-to-amihan-easterlies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">菲律宾部分地区周四因东北季风和偏东风影响将迎来降雨</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Rainy Thursday in parts of PH due to amihan, easterlies</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">菲律宾气象部门预测，受“阿米汉”东北季风和偏东气流的共同影响，本周四菲律宾部分地区将出现降雨天气，提醒居民注意防范，并可能影响出行安排。（地方新闻）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">菲律宾每日问询者</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/nov/05/david-jones-stores-closing-down-collapse-administration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">戴维·琼斯百货公司进入破产管理程序，预计将关闭门店并危及数千个工作岗位</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">David Jones goes into administration, with store closures expected and thousands of jobs at risk</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">英国老牌百货公司戴维·琼斯（David Jones）已正式进入破产管理程序，此举意味着公司可能面临大量门店关闭，并导致数千名员工面临失业风险，引发市场对零售业前景的担忧。（财经新闻）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">澳洲卫报</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.straitstimes.com/asia/east-asia/hong-kong-activist-joshua-wong-set-to-be-sentenced-on-national-security-charge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">香港民主运动标志性人物黄之锋或面临更长刑期</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Joshua Wong, Hong Kong pro-democracy poster boy facing longer prison stint</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">香港知名民主运动人士黄之锋，作为该运动的标志性人物，目前正面临法院对其判处更长监禁刑期的可能，此案持续受到国际社会和人权组织的广泛关注。（政治新闻）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">海峡时报(新加坡)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.japantimes.co.jp/news/2026/11/05/world/politics/texas-midterms-trump-musk-gop/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">德克萨斯州政治版图变蓝，共和党遭遇对特朗普和马斯克的惊人反击</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Texas turns blue in stunning rebuke of Donald Trump, Elon Musk and GOP</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">在美国中期选举中，传统上保守的德克萨斯州意外地“变蓝”，民主党在此地取得显著胜利，被视为对前总统特朗普、特斯拉CEO埃隆·马斯克及共和党政策的一次强烈民意反弹，引发美国政治格局深层变化讨论。（美国政治）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">日本时报</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.abc.net.au/news/2026-11-05/mount-fyans-sale-expected-to-break-farmland-record/107348504\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">维多利亚州一农场或以近1亿澳元价格出售引发市场关注</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Speculation Victorian farm could sell for close to $100 million</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">澳大利亚维多利亚州的一处大型农场据传正寻求出售，其估值可能接近1亿澳元，这笔潜在交易因涉及巨额资金而引发了当地房地产市场和农业投资领域的广泛关注。（澳洲财经）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">澳洲ABC新闻</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇳🇿 新西兰视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.rnz.co.nz/news/politics_election-2026/2356110/no-voting-stations-at-some-auckland-hospitals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">奥克兰部分医院未设投票站，病患或受影响</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">No voting stations at some Auckland hospitals</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">新西兰大选投票日临近，但奥克兰地区部分医院未设置投票站，引发民众对住院病人投票权利的担忧。此举可能导致部分无法离院的患者错失行使公民权利的机会。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">RNZ(新西兰国家广播)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.stuff.co.nz/motoring/361055427/new-chinese-ute-brand-jmc-begins-nz-testing-ahead-2027-la\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">中国江铃汽车品牌在新西兰启动测试，预计2027年上市</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">New Chinese ute brand JMC begins NZ testing ahead of 2027 launch</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">中国汽车品牌江铃汽车（JMC）已开始在新西兰进行皮卡车型的路测，为2027年正式进军新西兰市场做准备。这标志着又一中国汽车品牌寻求在国际市场扩张，将为当地消费者提供更多选择。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Stuff新闻</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://newsroom.co.nz/2026/11/05/homebuyers-face-big-bills-for-27b-plus-deferred-maintenance-on-nz-housing-stock/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">新西兰房屋存量面临超270亿纽元延期维护费，购房者或承担巨额账单</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Homebuyers face big bills for $27b-plus deferred maintenance on NZ housing stock</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">新西兰现有住房存量因长期维护不足，预计将产生超过270亿纽元的延期维护费用。这一巨额成本最终可能转嫁给未来的购房者，对住房市场和个人财务构成重大影响。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Newsroom(深度报道)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌐 中东·非洲·全球南方</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cr89znnnn7dno?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">查尔斯国王在英联邦日致辞中称奴隶贸易是“可耻篇章”</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">King calls slave trade a &#x27;shameful chapter&#x27; during Commonwealth address</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">英国国王查尔斯三世在英联邦日发表讲话，形容奴隶贸易是“我们历史上一个可耻的篇章”。此番言论正值英联邦内部对历史殖民遗产和奴役赔偿呼声日益高涨之际，具有重要的象征意义。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC拉丁美洲</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/11/4/who-gets-to-vote-in-the-us?traffic_source=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">谁有资格在美国投票？</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Who gets to vote in the US?</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">本文探讨了美国公民的投票资格，包括年龄、公民身份和居住地等基本要求，并分析了各州在选民注册和投票权方面存在的差异。了解这些规则对理解美国民主运作至关重要。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">半岛电视台(卡塔尔)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmrly6j6lpydo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">美国中期选举中崭露头角的非洲裔年轻政治家创造历史</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">The young politicians with African roots making history in the US midterms</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">在美国中期选举中，一批拥有非洲血统的年轻政治家脱颖而出，赢得选举并在美国政坛创造历史。这反映了美国政治多元化的趋势，也为少数族裔群体在政治参与方面树立了榜样。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC非洲</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c6d934npl9y8o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">伊朗首席谈判代表称美国人投票反对战争</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Iran&#x27;s chief negotiator says Americans voted &#x27;no to war&#x27;</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">伊朗核问题首席谈判代表阿里·巴盖里·卡尼表示，美国中期选举结果表明美国民众“对战争说不”，应推动华盛顿采取“现实”态度。此言论暗示伊朗在中东问题上寻求美国政策的转变。（官方视角）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC中东</span></div></div>\n</div></div>"
}